a-end=\"1319\" align=\"justify\">Compatible with <strong data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1214\">LGA1700 socket motherboards</strong>, this processor supports both <strong data-start=\"1245\" data-end=\"1253\">DDR5</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1258\" data-end=\"1266\">DDR4</strong> RAM, ensuring flexibility for various system builds.</p><h3 data-start=\"1460\" data-end=\"1485\"><br></h3>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/huawei-intel-10g-dual-port-sfp-ethernet-lan-card-with-mikrotik-level-6-license-ssd-combo-offer","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Mikrotik%20ROS/10G-Dual-SFP-Card_X4_Huawei-Intel_Super-Offer-NEW-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Huawei Intel 10G Dual Port SFP+ Ethernet LAN Card with Mikrotik Level 6 License SSD Combo Offer","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Huawei Intel 10G Dual Port SFP+ Ethernet LAN Card with Mikrotik Level 6 License SSD Combo Offer","now":"5,000৳","old":"9,000৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Tax:5,000৳","out":true},{"href":"/intel-100g-cwdm4-qsfp28-optical-transceiver-module","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/intel/Intel-100G-CWDM4-QSFP28-Optical-Transceiver-Module-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Intel 100G CWDM4 QSFP28 Optical Transceiver Module","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Intel 100G CWDM4 QSFP28 Optical Transceiver Module","now":"10,000৳","old":"12,000৳","single":"","tax":"Ex Tax:10,000৳","out":false},{"href":"/intel-10g-sfp-850nm-short-range-module-10gbase-sr-optical-transceiver","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/intel/Intel-10G-SFP+-850NM-Short-Range-Module-10GBASE-SR-Optical-Transceiver-100x100.jpg.webp","alt":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Module 10GBASE-SR Optical Transceiver","width":100,"height":100},"name":"Intel 10G SFP+ 850NM Short Range Modu